{"4992260": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Road66", "steam_appid": 4992260, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ># Game Overview</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ve been trapped in a mysterious hotel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your only companion is a chinchilla who’s also trapped in the hotel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together with the chinchilla to make your way down the hotel hallways, uncovering various anomalies along the way as you strive to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >## Rules</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No anomalies → Keep moving forward</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anomalies present → Turn back</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you overlook an anomaly, you might find yourself transported back to an unexpected location.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carefully observe your surroundings and work together with the chinchilla to determine the correct path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is an anomaly-hunting game inspired by *Exit 8*.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ># Game Overview</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ve been trapped in a mysterious hotel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your only companion is a chinchilla who’s also trapped in the hotel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together with the chinchilla to make your way down the hotel hallways, uncovering various anomalies along the way as you strive to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >## Rules</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No anomalies → Keep moving forward</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anomalies present → Turn back</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you overlook an anomaly, you might find yourself transported back to an unexpected location.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carefully observe your surroundings and work together with the chinchilla to determine the correct path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is an anomaly-hunting game inspired by *Exit 8*.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "A horror game combining the search for anomalies with an escape. If there are no anomalies, you move forward; if there are, you turn back. Aim to escape the hotel alongside your chinchilla.", "supported_languages": "English, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Japanese, Korean", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4992260/5df95a87c733b6d48d6c7a9130810689e652d5b3/header.jpg?t=1788339460", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4992260/bea698787acb4dadf2af569df19ad4e79e025882/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788339460", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4992260/bea698787acb4dadf2af569df19ad4e79e025882/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788339460", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-2100<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 4000<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Buttersand"], "publishers": ["Buttersand"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 75, "description": "Keyboard Only Option"}, {